{"symbol":"MAGNAELQ","yahoo":"MAGNAELQ.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Magna Electro Castings Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://www.magnacast.com","about":"Magna Electro Castings Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of cast iron components in India and internationally. It offers ductile iron, SiMo, compacted graphite iron, austempered ductile iron, and grey iron castings. The company is also involved in the generation of wind energy and exporting products. Its products are used in automobiles, hydraulics, pumps, marine, locomotives, engines, valves, gearboxes, off-highway, printing, flow control, and suspension components applications. The company was formerly known as Magna Electronics Limited and changed its name to Magna Electro Castings Limited in December 1992. Magna Electro Castings Limited was incorporated in 1990 and is headquartered in Coimbatore, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:57:59+00:00","quote":{"price":1300.0,"prevClose":1389.8,"marketCap":550.17,"high52":1600.0,"low52":706.0,"pe":35.45,"bookValue":342.62,"dividendRate":5.0,"roe":null,"shares":0.4232,"insiders":59.92,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024-08-28","2024-08-29","2024-08-30","2024-09-02","2024-09-03","2024-09-04","2024-09-05","2024-09-06","2024-09-09","2024-09-10","2024-09-11","2024-09-12","2024-09-13","2024-09-16","2024-09-17","2024-09-18","2024-09-19","2024-09-20","2024-09-23","2024-09-24","2024-09-25","2024-09-26","2024-09-27","2024-09-30","2024-10-01","2024-10-03","2024-10-04","2024-10-07","2024-10-08","2024-10-09","2024-10-10","2024-10-11","2024-10-14","2024-10-15","2024-10-16","2024-10-17","2024-10-18","2024-10-21","2024-10-22","2024-10-23","2024-10-24","2024-10-25","2024-10-28","2024-10-29","2024-10-30","2024-10-31","2024-11-01","2024-11-04","2024-11-05","2024-11-06","2024-11-07","2024-11-08","2024-11-11","2024-11-12"